Package: optee-client-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: arm64 armhf
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libckteec0t64 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libseteec0t64 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libteeacl0.1.0t64 (= ${binary:Version}),
         libteec2 (= ${binary:Version}),
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: OP-TEE client development files
 OP-TEE is a Trusted Execution Environment designed to run alongside
 a non-secure Linux kernel on Arm systems using TrustZone.
 .
 This package contains the headers and shared-library development
 files for the OP-TEE client APIs.

