Package: tee-supplicant
Architecture: arm64 armhf
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: OP-TEE supplicant daemon
 tee-supplicant provides normal-world services requested by OP-TEE,
 including access to the REE filesystem, RPMB and dynamically loaded
 trusted applications.
